{"last_link_id": 73, "nodes": [{"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["cot=\"full\"（默认）：模型会规划完整的乐谱，包含旋律 + 和弦。\n\ncot=\"melody\"：模型只规划单声部旋律，不生成和弦。这通常用于翻唱（Cover） 场景，当你提供了一段已有的旋律，不希望模型胡乱添加和弦破坏原曲结构时。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [280, 110], "pos": [-970.233154296875, 13.989477157592773], "id": 29, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 0}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "abc", "links": [70], "label": "abc", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "abc"}], "size": [280, 90], "pos": [-970.233154296875, -116.01022338867188], "widgets_values": ["full"], "inputs": [{"name": "audio_encoder", "link": 25, "label": "audio_encoder", "type": "AUDIO_ENCODER", "localized_name": "audio_encoder"}, {"name": "audio", "link": 26, "label": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio"}, {"widget": {"name": "mode"}, "name": "mode", "label": "mode", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "mode"}], "flags": {}, "id": 19, "type": "SheetSage2AudioToABC", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.35.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SheetSage2AudioToABC"}, "order": 7}, {"mode": 0, "showAdvanced": false, "outputs": [{"name": "abc", "links": [69], "label": "abc", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "abc"}], "size": [570, 360], "pos": [-1272.894775390625, -585.6273803710938], "widgets_values": ["New Orleans brass-funk, second-line drums, sousaphone, honky-tonk piano, trombone and baritone sax, playful Mandarin duet, 115 BPM", "[Verse 1]\n风过整夜 思念蔓延就像潮水\n窗外落叶 像梦里纷飞的青春画面\n我提笔写 把永远念你写进故事末页\n你是我此生最深的挂牵\n\n[Verse 2]\n云追整夜 我的梦飘散就像烟灰\n檐下燕子 像书中掠过的温柔片段\n我继续写 把所有心事折成纸鸢\n你是我唯一想去的终点\n\n[Chorus]\n那金色的麦浪 温暖了这个秋天\n而你的侧脸像画里盛开的水仙\n你忽然对我说 蒹葭的名字很甜\n我此刻却只想拥抱你微凉的双肩\n\n那南飞的大雁 约好了归来的期限\n而你的声音像夜里叮咚的清泉\n你轻声对我说 蒹葭的名字很甜\n我此刻却只想拥抱你微凉的双肩\n\n[Interlude]\n（钢琴伴奏）\n\n[Verse 3]\n月落整夜 我的笔停在那一页\n烛火摇曳 照亮了纸上未干的字眼\n我不忍写 把所有遗憾留给明天\n你是我最后写下的诗篇\n\n[Chorus]\n那金色的麦浪 温暖了这个秋天\n而你的侧脸像画里盛开的水仙\n你忽然对我说 蒹葭的名字很甜\n我此刻却只想拥抱你微凉的双肩\n\n那南飞的大雁 约好了归来的期限\n而你的声音像夜里叮咚的清泉\n你轻声对我说 蒹葭的名字很甜\n我此刻却只想拥抱你微凉的双肩\n\n[Outro]\n你是我最后写下的诗篇", 972331543381512, "randomize", "full", 8192, 0.7, 0.9, 30, 1.005, 100], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 38, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "style"}, "name": "style", "link": 65, "label": "style", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "style"}, {"widget": {"name": "lyrics"}, "name": "lyrics", "link": 67, "label": "lyrics", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "lyrics"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "mode"}, "name": "mode", "label": "mode", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "mode"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_abc_tokens"}, "name": "max_abc_tokens", "label": "max_abc_tokens", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "max_abc_tokens"}, {"widget": {"name": "temperature"}, "name": "temperature", "label": "temperature", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "temperature"}, {"widget": {"name": "top_p"}, "name": "top_p", "label": "top_p", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "top_p"}, {"widget": {"name": "top_k"}, "name": "top_k", "label": "top_k", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "top_k"}, {"widget": {"name": "repetition_penalty"}, "name": "repetition_penalty", "label": "repetition_penalty", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "repetition_penalty"}, {"widget": {"name": "penalty_window"}, "name": "penalty_window", "label": "penalty_window", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "penalty_window"}], "flags": {}, "id": 23, "type": "YuE2GenerateABC", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.35.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {"style": true, "lyrics": true}, "Node name for S&R": "YuE2GenerateABC"}, "order": 8}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "AUDIO_ENCODER", "links": [25], "label": "AUDIO_ENCODER", "type": "AUDIO_ENCODER", "localized_name": "AUDIO_ENCODER"}], "size": [290, 70], "pos": [-1282.3753662109375, -119.38301849365234], "widgets_values": ["sheetsage2_bf1